{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":207658,"duration_api_ms":264000,"num_turns":26,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6c2a7ac1-34ec-4ced-a806-9aa527862508","total_cost_usd":1.27866455,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":71464,"cache_read_input_tokens":746038,"output_tokens":7371,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":71464,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1312,"outputTokens":11198,"cacheReadInputTokens":1034298,"cacheCreationInputTokens":91143,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.27466055000000006,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":7371,"cacheReadInputTokens":746038,"cacheCreationInputTokens":71464,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.004004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 49 tank_core lib tests pass, including snapshot_tds_and_conductivity_use_fresh_carbonate_projection, snapshot_deserializes_legacy_chemistry_aliases, snapshot_deserializes_enriched_api_payload_with_canonical_precedence, and snapshot_uses_one_carbonate_solution_for_ph_and_co2.","All 11 concentration_helpers integration tests pass, including tds_helpers_ignore_stale_bicarbonate_cache which proves state.tds_mg_per_l() ignores the cached bicarbonate_mg_total and uses a fresh carbonate solve.","All 3 tank_api tests pass: snapshot_response_keeps_legacy_chemistry_aliases, chemistry_response_explains_estimate_scope, biology_snapshot_keeps_total_and_stage_breakdown.","All 10 tank_tui lib tests pass, including overview_uses_shared_nh3_n_unit_label, overview_labels_tds_and_conductivity_as_estimates, parses_enriched_api_snapshot_response, and parses_load_response_with_legacy_snapshot_chemistry_field_names.","All 7 events integration tests pass, including threshold_event_summaries_use_explicit_chemistry_units.","cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_api -p tank_tui -- -D warnings: clean, zero warnings.","Snapshot fields verified with explicit unit suffixes: tan_mg_n_per_l, nh3_mg_n_per_l, nitrite_mg_n_per_l, nitrate_mg_n_per_l, phosphate_mg_p_per_l, dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_per_l, estimated_tds_7_ion_mg_per_l, estimated_conductivity_us_cm (snapshot.rs:30-45).","Amendment fr-4-2b018d6f (NH3 label) resolved: Both overview.rs and chemistry.rs use shared constant NH3_N_DISPLAY_UNIT = 'mg NH3-N/L' from screens/mod.rs:12. Test overview_uses_shared_nh3_n_unit_label confirms.","Amendment fr-4-84ddc83e (deserialization compatibility) resolved: normalize_snapshot_object() in tank_core::types::snapshot (lines 206-216) applies legacy alias normalization during TankSnapshot custom Deserialize impl (lines 218-229). Tests snapshot_deserializes_legacy_chemistry_aliases and snapshot_deserializes_enriched_api_payload_with_canonical_precedence confirm any Rust consumer gets automatic compatibility.","Amendment fr-4-83b30b59 (TDS/conductivity divergence) resolved: WaterState::tds_mg_per_l() now delegates to estimated_dissolved_solids() which calls projected_carbonate_equilibrium() for a fresh solve (water.rs:217-218,234-239). Snapshot test lines 441-450 assert snapshot.estimated_tds_7_ion_mg_per_l == state.tds_mg_per_l() within 1e-12, proving convergence.","Conversion constants centralized in conversions.rs with molar-mass derivations: NO3_PER_N (62.004/14.007), NO2_PER_N (46.005/14.007), NH4_PER_N (18.039/14.007), NH3_PER_N (17.031/14.007), PO4_PER_P (94.971/30.974). 7 unit tests verify reference values, round-trip accuracy, and zero preservation.","GH/KH constants named and documented in water.rs: CALCIUM_AS_CACO3_FACTOR, MAGNESIUM_AS_CACO3_FACTOR, MG_CACO3_PER_MEQ, MG_CACO3_PER_DEGREE, MOLAR_MASS_CACO3_G_PER_MOL, etc.","TDS scope metadata centralized in tank_core (water.rs:29-44): ESTIMATED_TDS_TRACKED_MAJOR_IONS, ESTIMATED_TDS_OMITTED_CONTRIBUTORS, ESTIMATED_TDS_SCOPE_LINES — consumed by both API (estimated_tds_scope_json) and TUI (scope lines on overview and chemistry screens) without duplication.","API backward compatibility maintained: insert_legacy_chemistry_fields() backfills 8 old field names. snapshot_response_json() used on /snapshot, /time/step, /load, and /scenarios/load endpoints. chemistry_field_semantics, estimated_tds_scope, and legacy_chemistry_aliases metadata included."],"findings_or_gaps":["The conversions module is public but has no internal callers — it serves as a library API for external consumers. This is documented behavior per UNITS.md and was rejected as an amendment (fr-4-c9fd9fff) since it is not a correctness defect.","No dedicated end-to-end TUI render test asserts exact screen output; only targeted label, scope-line, and estimate-prefix assertions exist. Acceptable since the TUI is not a stable API surface.","The overview hardware panel inserts 3 scope lines which may overflow on very small terminals — a known aesthetic tradeoff for transparency about what the estimate covers.","An unrelated clippy warning in crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs (redundant_field_names) persists but is outside the scope of this bead."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fa4c5726-525d-4e11-bc3a-e878746df1c5"}
